       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DEEP-SURFACE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DEEP-SURFACE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-UNDERLYING-SURFACE-BIJECT PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CASE-ROLE-TRANSFORMATION PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRANSFORMATIONAL-GRAMMAR PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SEMANTIC-COMPONENT-INV   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNIVERSAL-SKELETON-MAP   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DEEP-SURFACE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-DEEP-SURFACE-PROVEN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DEEP-SURFACE-CODE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DEEP-TO-SURFACE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TRANSFORMATIONS.
           PERFORM 3000-EVALUATE-SKELETON-MAPPING.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-DEEP-SURFACE-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DEEP-TO-SURFACE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNDERLYING-SURFACE-BIJECT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CASE-ROLE-TRANSFORMATION.
       2000-EVALUATE-TRANSFORMATIONS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRANSFORMATIONAL-GRAMMAR.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SEMANTIC-COMPONENT-INV.
       3000-EVALUATE-SKELETON-MAPPING.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIVERSAL-SKELETON-MAP.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-DEEP-SURFACE-PROOFS.
           IF WS-UNDERLYING-SURFACE-BIJECT = 1 AND
              WS-CASE-ROLE-TRANSFORMATION = 1 AND
              WS-TRANSFORMATIONAL-GRAMMAR = 1 AND
              WS-SEMANTIC-COMPONENT-INV = 1 AND
              WS-UNIVERSAL-SKELETON-MAP = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-DEEP-SURFACE-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DEEP-SURFACE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-DEEP-SURFACE-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DEEP-SURFACE-CODE.
